GIT:

first we need to create a directory <mkdir>
now we need to initlize git using <git init>
now .git hidden file will be created.
Then we need add remote repository using <git add remote origin url >
Now to create file we use <vi filename>
Now to add the file to staging area using <git add .>
Now to add the file to local repo using <git commit -m "message" filename>
Now to create a new branch we use <git branch name>
Now to switch to the new branch we use <git checkout branch name >
Now to list the branches we use <git branch>
Now to push the branch we use <git push origin (branch-name)>
Now to clone the remote repository we use <git clone url>
